        48.28499984741211,
        415.1968078613281,
        299.7025451660156,
        424.7727966308594
      ],
      "charspan": [
        1646,
        1704
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "(orders of magnification). They can better understand the",
      "bbox": [
        48.56999969482422,
        426.71783447265625,
        299.70257568359375,
        436.31280517578125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        1706,
        1763
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "natural language and generate high-quality text based on",
      "bbox": [
        48.05699920654297,
        438.2768249511719,
        299.9019775390625,
        447.8528137207031
      ],
      "charspan": [
        1765,
        1821
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "the given context (i.e., prompts). Such a capacity improve￾ment can be partially described by the scaling law, where",
      "bbox": [
        48.152000427246094,
        449.81683349609375,
        299.80401611328125,
        470.9328308105469
      ],
      "charspan": [
        1823,
        1939
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "the performance roughly follows a substantial increase with",
      "bbox": [
        48.20899963378906,
        472.87786865234375,
        299.9020080566406,
        482.47283935546875
      ],
      "charspan": [
        1941,
        2000
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "respect to the model size [30]. However, some abilities (e.g.,",
      "bbox": [
        48.199501037597656,
        484.4368591308594,
        299.5539855957031,
        493.9938659667969
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2002,
        2064
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "in-context learning [55]) are unpredictable according to the",
      "bbox": [
        48.199501037597656,
        495.97686767578125,
        299.7025146484375,
        505.5528564453125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2066,
        2126
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "scaling law, which can be observed only when the model",
      "bbox": [
        48.28499984741211,
        507.5168762207031,
        299.80706787109375,
        517.0928649902344
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2128,
        2182
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "size exceeds a certain level (as discussed below).",
      "bbox": [
        48.28499984741211,
        519.056884765625,
        252.2025146484375,
        527.9868774414062
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2184,
        2234
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "Emergent Abilities of LLMs. In the literature [31], emergent",
      "bbox": [
        48.37049865722656,
        537.7168884277344,
        299.7820129394531,
        547.2263946533203
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2236,
        2296
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "abilities of LLMs are formally defined as “the abilities that",
      "bbox": [
        48.03801345825195,
        549.1903839111328,
        299.93603515625,
        558.8328857421875
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2298,
        2359
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "are not present in small models but arise in large models”,",
      "bbox": [
        48.304019927978516,
        560.796875,
        299.69305419921875,
        570.3728790283203
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2361,
        2420
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "which is one of the most distinctive features that distinguish",
      "bbox": [
        48.0570182800293,
        572.31787109375,
        299.90203857421875,
        581.9128723144531
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2422,
        2484
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "LLMs from previous PLMs. It also introduces a notable",
      "bbox": [
        48.20901870727539,
        583.8578643798828,
        299.7025146484375,
        593.4338684082031
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2486,
        2539
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "characteristic when emergent abilities occur: performance",
      "bbox": [
        48.24702072143555,
        595.3978576660156,
        299.7025451660156,
        604.9928588867188
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2541,
        2598
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "rises significantly above random when the scale reaches",
      "bbox": [
        48.199520111083984,
        606.9378509521484,
        299.6835632324219,
        616.5328521728516
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2600,
        2655
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "a certain level. By analogy, such an emergent pattern has",
      "bbox": [
        48.304019927978516,
        618.4968414306641,
        299.6835632324219,
        628.0728454589844
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2657,
        2714
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "close connections with the phenomenon of phase transition in",
      "bbox": [
        48.24702072143555,
        629.9703369140625,
        299.905517578125,
        639.5938415527344
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2716,
        2776
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "physics [31, 58]. In principle, emergent abilities can be also",
      "bbox": [
        48.07603073120117,
        641.5768280029297,
        299.69305419921875,
        651.15283203125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2778,
        2840
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "defined in relation to some complex tasks [31, 59], while",
      "bbox": [
        48.3325309753418,
        653.0978240966797,
        299.7025146484375,
        662.673828125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2842,
        2899
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "we are more concerned with general abilities that can be",
      "bbox": [
        48.057029724121094,
        664.6568222045898,
        299.7025146484375,
        674.2328262329102
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2901,
        2957
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "applied to solve multiple tasks. Here, we briefly introduce",
      "bbox": [
        48.30403137207031,
        676.1778259277344,
        299.7025451660156,
        685.7728271484375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        2959,
        3018
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "three representative emergent abilities for LLMs, described",
      "bbox": [
        48.20903015136719,
        687.7178268432617,
        299.69305419921875,
        697.3128280639648
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3020,
        3079
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "as follows.",
      "bbox": [
        48.30403137207031,
        699.2578277587891,
        92.19403076171875,
        706.3543243408203
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3081,
        3092
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "5. In existing literature, there is no a formal consensus on the min￾imum parameter scale for LLMs. In this survey, we mainly focus on",
      "bbox": [
        48.16802978515625,
        720.350830078125,
        299.9200439453125,
        737.4308280944824
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3094,
        3228
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "discussing LLMs with a model size larger than 10B.",
      "bbox": [
        48.280029296875,
        738.366828918457,
        231.20806884765625,
        746.4308280944824
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3230,
        3280
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "• In-context learning. The in-context learning ability is for￾mally introduced by GPT-3 [55]: assuming that the language",
      "bbox": [
        312.15203857421875,
        44.81231689453125,
        563.7975463867188,
        65.99481201171875
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3282,
        3402
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "model has been provided with a natural language instruc￾tion and/or several task demonstrations, it can generate the",
      "bbox": [
        312.15203857421875,
        67.95880126953125,
        563.797607421875,
        89.07476806640625
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3404,
        3520
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "expected output for the test instances by completing the",
      "bbox": [
        312.2470397949219,
        91.01971435546875,
        563.7025146484375,
        100.61474609375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3522,
        3578
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "word sequence of input text, without requiring additional",
      "bbox": [
        312.0570373535156,
        102.5596923828125,
        563.8070068359375,
        112.15472412109375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3580,
        3637
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "training or gradient updates6",
      "bbox": [
        312.20904541015625,
        112.81884765625,
        434.6962585449219,
        123.6947021484375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3639,
        3668
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": ".",
      "bbox": [
        436.0435485839844,
        119.961181640625,
        437.1455383300781,
        121.0537109375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3670,
        3671
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "• Instruction following. By fine-tuning with a mixture",
      "bbox": [
        326.7980041503906,
        126.84521484375,
        563.7020263671875,
        136.48773193359375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3673,
        3727
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "of multi-task datasets formatted via natural language de￾scriptions (i.e., instructions), LLMs are shown to perform",
      "bbox": [
        312.2850646972656,
        138.43267822265625,
        563.8705444335938,
        159.54864501953125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3729,
        3844
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "well on unseen tasks that are also described in the form of",
      "bbox": [
        312.05706787109375,
        161.51263427734375,
        564.0730590820312,
        168.609130859375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3846,
        3905
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "instructions [28, 61, 62]. With this ability, instruction tuning",
      "bbox": [
        312.1995544433594,
        173.0716552734375,
        563.883056640625,
        182.64764404296875
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3907,
        3971
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "enables LLMs to perform new tasks by understanding the",
      "bbox": [
        312.2470703125,
        184.59259033203125,
        563.7025756835938,
        194.1876220703125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        3973,
        4027
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "task instructions without using explicit examples, which can",
      "bbox": [
        312.2090759277344,
        196.151611328125,
        563.902099609375,
        205.72760009765625
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4029,
        4089
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "largely improve the generalization ability.",
      "bbox": [
        312.1995544433594,
        207.69158935546875,
        487.7215576171875,
        217.267578125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4091,
        4134
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "• Step-by-step reasoning. For small language models, it is",
      "bbox": [
        326.7980041503906,
        220.41705322265625,
        563.6840209960938,
        230.0595703125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4136,
        4194
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "usually difficult to solve complex tasks that involve multiple",
      "bbox": [
        312.1710510253906,
        232.0045166015625,
        563.7025146484375,
        241.59954833984375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4196,
        4258
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "reasoning steps, e.g., mathematical word problems. While,",
      "bbox": [
        312.1995544433594,
        243.56353759765625,
        563.695068359375,
        253.1395263671875
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4260,
        4317
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "with the chain-of-thought reasoning strategy [33], LLMs can",
      "bbox": [
        312.0570983886719,
        255.08447265625,
        563.902099609375,
        264.67950439453125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4319,
        4378
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "solve such tasks by utilizing the prompting mechanism that",
      "bbox": [
        312.28509521484375,
        266.64349365234375,
        563.9306640625,
        276.219482421875
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4380,
        4438
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "involves intermediate reasoning steps for deriving the final",
      "bbox": [
        312.1995849609375,
        278.16448974609375,
        563.80712890625,
        287.75946044921875
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4440,
        4500
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "answer. This ability is speculated to be potentially obtained",
      "bbox": [
        312.3040771484375,
        289.7234802246094,
        563.693115234375,
        299.2994689941406
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4502,
        4563
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "by training on code [33, 47].",
      "bbox": [
        311.8670959472656,
        301.26348876953125,
        429.2205810546875,
        310.8394775390625
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4565,
        4594
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Key Techniques for LLMs. It has been a long way that",
      "bbox": [
        312.37060546875,
        320.739501953125,
        563.93359375,
        330.31549072265625
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4596,
        4648
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "LLMs evolve into the current state: general and capable",
      "bbox": [
        312.2091064453125,
        332.2130126953125,
        563.8580932617188,
        341.78900146484375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4650,
        4705
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "learners. In the development process, a number of impor￾tant techniques are proposed, which largely improve the",
      "bbox": [
        312.1995544433594,
        343.800537109375,
        563.7975463867188,
        364.9355163574219
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4707,
        4818
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "capacity of LLMs. Here, we briefly list several important",
      "bbox": [
        312.2470703125,
        366.88055419921875,
        563.9306030273438,
        376.47552490234375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4820,
        4877
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "techniques that (potentially) lead to the success of LLMs, as",
      "bbox": [
        312.2090759277344,
        378.4205627441406,
        563.68359375,
        388.0155334472656
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4879,
        4940
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "follows.",
      "bbox": [
        312.21856689453125,
        389.9605712890625,
        344.7560729980469,
        397.05706787109375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4942,
        4950
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "• Scaling. Scaling is the key factor to increase the model",
      "bbox": [
        326.7980041503906,
        402.7050476074219,
        563.8125610351562,
        412.3475341796875
      ],
      "charspan": [
        4952,
        5010
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "capacity of LLMs. As the initial attempt, GPT-3 firstly in￾creases the model size to an extremely large scale of 175B",
      "bbox": [
        312.2470703125,
        414.2925720214844,
        563.797607421875,
        435.42755126953125
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5012,
        5129
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "parameters. Later on, PaLM further raises the parameter",
      "bbox": [
        312.0760498046875,
        437.3725891113281,
        563.797607421875,
        446.9485778808594
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5131,
        5186
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "scale to a new record of 540B. As discussed before, a large",
      "bbox": [
        312.2850646972656,
        448.91259765625,
        563.7025146484375,
        458.507568359375
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5188,
        5247
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "model size is essential to emergent abilities. While, scaling",
      "bbox": [
        312.1520690917969,
        460.4715881347656,
        563.883056640625,
        470.0475769042969
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5249,
        5310
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "is not only conducted on model size but also related to",
      "bbox": [
        312.1995544433594,
        472.0115966796875,
        563.6930541992188,
        481.58758544921875
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5312,
        5367
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "data size and total compute [34, 63]. A recent study [34]",
      "bbox": [
        312.3325500488281,
        483.5516052246094,
        563.24658203125,
        493.1275939941406
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5369,
        5426
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "has discussed the optimal schedule among the three aspects",
      "bbox": [
        312.05706787109375,
        495.09161376953125,
        563.68359375,
        504.6676025390625
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5428,
        5486
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "of model size, data size, and total compute, given a fixed",
      "bbox": [
        312.3040466308594,
        506.6126403808594,
        563.6930541992188,
        516.2076110839844
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5488,
        5546
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "budget. Further, the quality of the pre-training data plays",
      "bbox": [
        311.8670654296875,
        518.1526489257812,
        563.68359375,
        527.7476196289062
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5548,
        5607
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "a key role in achieving good performance, so that data",
      "bbox": [
        312.3040466308594,
        529.692626953125,
        563.7216186523438,
        539.2876281738281
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5609,
        5663
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "collection and cleaning strategies are very important to",
      "bbox": [
        312.2470703125,
        541.2516174316406,
        563.6930541992188,
        550.8276214599609
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5665,
        5721
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "consider when scaling the pre-training corpora.",
      "bbox": [
        312.2470703125,
        552.7916107177734,
        511.94659423828125,
        562.3676147460938
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5723,
        5770
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "• Training. Due to the huge model size, it is very chal￾lenging to successfully train a capable LLM. Distributed",
      "bbox": [
        312.1995544433594,
        565.5846099853516,
        563.8050537109375,
        586.7006072998047
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5772,
        5884
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "training algorithms are needed to learn the network param￾eters of LLMs, in which various parallel strategies are of￾ten jointly utilized. To support distributed training, several",
      "bbox": [
        312.2090759277344,
        588.6645965576172,
        563.8070678710938,
        621.3205871582031
      ],
      "charspan": [
        5886,
        6065
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "optimization frameworks have been released to facilitate",
      "bbox": [
        312.3040466308594,
        623.2655792236328,
        563.7025756835938,
        632.8415832519531
      ],
      "charspan": [
        6067,
        6123
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "the implementation and deployment of parallel algorithms,",
      "bbox": [
        312.2090759277344,
        634.8055725097656,
        563.6930541992188,
        644.4005737304688
      ],
      "charspan": [
        6125,
        6182
      ]
    },
    {
